-- sender.talk: the mailbox-depth case. Grants come from case.toml: log: write
-- Sends three messages to `sink` in one Segment, so `sink` has no turn to
-- dispatch any of them before the third.

on flood
  repeat for each n in 1..3
    try
      send note with n to sink
    catch "mailbox full"
      tell log to write "full at " & n
    end try
  end repeat
end flood
